    "statementTitle": "nothing\nhappens\ntwice",
    "statementCopy": "the same moment never comes back.\nTNES. is built around noticing the people,\nplaces, and details that will never exist in\nquite the same way again — and giving them\na life after they pass.",
    "statementArtworkId": "the-pool",
    "selectedWorksTitle": "selected works",
    "seo": {
      "title": "TNES. — Fine Art Photography by Victor Safdie Levy",
      "description": "Photographs of the moments that never happen twice. Explore the works, catalogs and studio of Victor Safdie Levy."
    }
  },
  "works": {
    "eyebrow": "tnes. opening selection",
    "title": "Works",
    "description": "Photographs from across the archive. Each is shown in its complete composition and offered for inquiry as a physical work.",
    "catalogsTitle": "catalogs.",
    "catalogsSubtitle": "work from the archive, gathered into sets. a place, a season, a way of looking.",
    "seo": {
      "title": "Works — TNES.",
      "description": "Explore fine art photographs by Victor Safdie Levy. Archival pigment prints available by inquiry."
    }
  },
  "about": {
    "name": "victor\nsafdie\nlevy",
    "role": "ARTIST AND FOUNDER OF TNES.",
    "statement": "I started taking photographs as a way of keeping track of time — where I was, who was there, and what was happening before it became something else. I was always more interested in people and places as I found them: unposed, unplanned, already in motion. Over time, that personal archive became TNES., a studio built around one idea: nothing happens twice.",
    "heroImage": {
      "src": "https://cdn.sanity.io/images/bchwhnoq/production/a451e6b297cdcadd3aad304e34026c049c24beef-1800x1200.webp",
      "alt": "Victor stamping and signing a print at the studio desk",
      "width": 1800,
      "height": 1200
    },
    "splitImage": {
      "src": "https://cdn.sanity.io/images/bchwhnoq/production/2d7e683b305d421ca1c8c0bbbf83337459519231-1350x1800.webp",
      "alt": "Victor on a subway platform, print under his arm",
      "width": 1350,
      "height": 1800
    },
    "splitTitle": "the photograph\nis what is left\nof the looking.",
    "splitText": "no one goes back for a moment. stand in the same place a year later and it hands you something else. what is here is one person's record of time and space. not a group show, not a marketplace.\n\nowning a piece is keeping the minute someone stopped, and deciding it was worth keeping. good or bad, nothing happens twice.",
    "ctaLabel": "enter the mind in VSL",
